Adinkra symbol artwork in this directory is from Adinkra Icons
(https://github.com/kevinkhagan/adinkra-icons) by Kevin K. Hagan,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Files were copied unmodified except that `fill` is rewritten to
`currentColor` at render time so the symbols inherit the surrounding
text colour. Two files were renamed for clarity:
  sankofa-two.svg                 -> sankofa.svg
  funtunfunefu-denkyemfunefu.svg  -> funtunfunefu.svg

The Adinkra symbols themselves are traditional designs of the Akan
people of Ghana and Côte d'Ivoire.
